  "description": "Advanced touch effects for .NET MAUI applications. Features fluent builder API, 20+ preset configurations, Windows platform support, comprehensive logging, and rich interaction feedback with animations, hover states, and platform-specific effects. Enterprise-ready with zero magic numbers and extensive documentation. A MarketAlly product based on the original TouchEffect.",
