  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0: .NET 10 support, new TouchBehavior class (Behavior-based alternative to Effects), thread-safe architecture with proper synchronization, integrated logging via ITouchEffectLogger, code organization improvements (partial classes), ForceUpdateStateWithoutAnimation bug fix, performance improvements (LINQ replaced with for-loops in hot paths), proper CancellationTokenSource disposal pattern.",
